  "summary": "Problem: Define an org-scoped subscriber program that grants customers eligibility for special pricing, inventory access, and purchase restrictions, while keeping billing external (initially WordPress).\nGoals:\n- Treat subscriber as an entitlement (not an IAM role)\n- Make eligibility auditable and snapshot at purchase-finalize time\n- Support tiers, grace periods, pending_activation, and revocation\n- Support 'visible-but-locked' offers (upsell) without allowing purchase\n- Support per-customer quotas per event with override\n- Provide deterministic hooks for analytics, abuse detection, and DSAR\nNon-goals:\n- Running subscription billing or charging cards (delegated to external provider initially)\n- Replacing IAM-1 authorization model\n- Implementing seating maps (SEAT-2)",
